 [level=3] [ref=e303]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e304]: Dragon Boat Racing\n              - generic [ref=e305]:\n                - generic [ref=e306]:\n                  - img [ref=e307]\n                  - generic [ref=e310]: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                - paragraph [ref=e311]: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e312] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e313]\n            - generic [ref=e315]:\n              - generic [ref=e316]:\n                - img \"剪纸\" [ref=e317]\n                - generic [ref=e319]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e320]:\n                  - heading \"剪纸\" [level=3] [ref=e321]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e322]: Paper Cutting\n              - generic [ref=e323]:\n                - generic [ref=e324]:\n                  - img [ref=e325]\n                  - generic [ref=e328]: 陕西 · 黄土高原\n                - paragraph [ref=e329]: 剪纸是中国最古老的民间艺术之一，用剪刀或刻刀在纸上剪刻花纹，寓意吉祥美好。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e330] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/paper-cutting\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e331]\n            - generic [ref=e369]:\n              - generic [ref=e370]:\n                - img \"书法\" [ref=e371]\n                - generic [ref=e373]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e374]:\n                  - heading \"书法\" [level=3] [ref=e375]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e376]: Chinese Calligraphy\n              - generic [ref=e377]:\n                - generic [ref=e378]:\n                  - img [ref=e379]\n                  - generic [ref=e382]: 安徽 · 神州墨韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e383]: 书法是中国特有的艺术形式，以毛笔书写汉字，融合了文字、绘画与哲学的精髓。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e384] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/chinese-calligraphy\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e385]\n            - ge